+# --- Custom GPIO LEDs (PI12, PI15) ---
+/sys/devices/platform/gpio-leds/leds/pi12_out  brightness  0666  system  system
+/sys/devices/platform/gpio-leds/leds/pi15_out  brightness  0666  system  system
